{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 50,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.50.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A Psalm of Asaph. The mighty God, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the LORD, hath spoken, and called the earth from the rising to the setting of the sun.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.50.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Out of Zion, the perfection of beauty, God hath shined.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.50.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Our God shall come, and shall not keep silence: a fire shall devour before him, and it shall be very tempestuous around him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.50.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He shall call to the heavens from above, and to the earth, that he may judge his people.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.50.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Gather my saints together to me; those that have made a covenant with me by sacrifice.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.50.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the heavens shall declare his righteousness: for God ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " judge himself. Selah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.50.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Hear, O my people, and I will speak; O Israel, and I will testify against thee: I ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "am",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " God, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thy God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.50.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will not reprove thee for thy sacrifices or thy burnt-offerings, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "to have been",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " continually before me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.50.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will take no bullock out of thy house, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "nor",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he-goats out of thy folds.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.50.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For every beast of the forest ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " mine, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the cattle upon a thousand hills.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.50.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I know all the fowls of the mountains: and the wild beasts of the field ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " mine.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.50.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If I were hungry, I would not tell thee: for the world ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " mine, and the fullness thereof.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.50.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Will I eat the flesh of bulls, or drink the blood of goats?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.50.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Offer to God thanksgiving; and pay thy vows to the Most High:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.50.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And call upon me in the day of trouble: I will deliver thee, and thou shalt glorify me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.50.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But to the wicked God saith, What hast thou to do to declare my statutes, or ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thou shouldest take my covenant in thy mouth?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.50.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Seeing thou hatest instruction, and castest my words behind thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.50.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When thou sawest a thief, then thou consentedst with him, and hast been partaker with adulterers.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.50.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou givest thy mouth to evil, and thy tongue frameth deceit.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.50.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou sittest ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " speakest against thy brother; thou slanderest thy own mother's son.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.50.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "These ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "things",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " hast thou done, and I kept silence; thou thoughtest that I was altogether ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "such an one",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " as thyself: ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "but",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " I will reprove thee, and set ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in order before thine eyes.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.50.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now consider this, ye that forget God, lest I tear ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "you",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in pieces, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " none to deliver.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.50.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.50.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whoever offereth praise glorifieth me: and to him that ordereth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " deportment ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "aright",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " will I show the salvation of God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
